Patch
• Calling test_server.query({})


  ◇ Apply proposed changes?

  Description: Allow the pending call to continue.
  Destination: unavailable

› 1. Apply changes (y)
     Applies only these proposed changes.
  2. Allow these paths for this session (a)
     Allows changes to these paths for this session.
  3. Tell Codex what to do instead (esc)
     Keeps these proposed changes from being applied.

  enter select · esc stop & reply

Elicitation
• Calling test_server.query({})


  Field 1/1
  Allow the pending call to continue?
  › 1. Allow   Allow this request and continue.
    2. Deny    Decline this request and continue.
    3. Cancel  Cancel this request
  enter to submit | esc to cancel

Permissions
• Calling test_server.query({})


  ◇ Grant additional permissions?

  Reason: Allow the pending call to continue.

  Permission rule: network

› 1. Allow for this turn (y)
     Applies only to the current turn.
  2. Allow this turn with strict review (r)
     Applies this turn and keeps strict review enabled.
  3. Allow for this session (a)
     Applies through the current session.
  4. Don't allow (d)
     Continues without granting access.

  enter select · esc deny

